{"id": "19-758-2-8", "zh": "amu 之后的 sa 不变为 no。", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "19-758-9-13", "zh": "amussa，amūsaṃ、amūsānaṃ。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "19-758-14-27", "zh": "依“nāsmāssa”规则，la 之后的 smā 变为 nā，得 amunā、amumhā、amusmā。", "confidence": 72}
{"id": "19-758-28-32", "zh": "amumhi、amusmiṃ，amūsu。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "19-759-2-7", "zh": "阴性：asu，amū、amuyo。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-759-8-12", "zh": "amuṃ，amū、amuyo。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "19-759-13-38", "zh": "nā：依“ssā vā tetimāmūhi”规则，nā 等单数格尾可选地变为 ssā，得 amussā、amuyā，amūhi、amūbhi。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-759-39-44", "zh": "amussā、amuyā，amūsaṃ、amūsānaṃ。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "19-759-45-52", "zh": "第七格：amussaṃ、amussā、amuyaṃ、amuyā，amūsu。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-760-2-3", "zh": "中性——", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "19-761-2-6", "zh": "202. amu 变为 aduṃ", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "19-762-2-10", "zh": "在中性中，amu 连同 aṃ、si 两个格尾可选地变为 aduṃ。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-762-11-16", "zh": "得 aduṃ；不替换时省略 si，得 amuṃ。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-762-17-27", "zh": "依“jhalā vā”规则可选地替换为 ni，得 amūni、amū。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-762-28-33", "zh": "aduṃ、amuṃ，amūni、amū。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "19-762-34-37", "zh": "amunā 等与阳性相同。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-763-2-9", "zh": "依“sakatthe”规则加 ka 词缀时——", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-764-2-5", "zh": "130. 在 ka 之前可选地", "confidence": 72}
{"id": "19-765-2-54", "zh": "amu 本身就是 amuka：以本义加 ka 词缀，因为属于派生词（taddhita）构造，依“ekatthatāyaṃ”规则省略了 si；按照“因缘不存在时，所生者也不存在”的通则，作为因缘的 si 既然不存在，依“massāmussa”本应进行的 s 替换也就不再发生，所以制定“ke vā”这条规则，使 m 可选地变为 s。", "confidence": 62}
{"id": "19-765-55-61", "zh": "在 ka 之前，amu 的 m 可选地变为 s。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-765-62-67", "zh": "asuko、amukā，asukā、amukā。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "19-765-68-71", "zh": "asukaṃ、amukaṃ 等等。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-766-2-4", "zh": "kiṃ + si。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-767-2-6", "zh": "198. kiṃ 在一切格中变为 ka", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-768-2-7", "zh": "在一切格尾之前，kiṃ 变为 ka。", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "19-768-8-13", "zh": "si 变为 o，得 ko，ke。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "19-768-14-17", "zh": "kaṃ，ke。", "confidence": 88}
